# User-Directed Verification

If the user says not to run tests, builds, lint, or similar verification commands unless asked, follow that preference for this repository.

- Do not run `npm run test`, `npm run build`, lint, or other verification commands unless the user explicitly requests them.
- This preference overrides the default "verify before done" guidance for this repo when the user has stated it in the conversation.
- When you skip verification because of this preference, say so briefly in the final handoff.
- Read-only inspection commands are still fine when needed.
